[1.66,"o","\r\n"]
[1.72,"o","This repo's config suggests Anthropic: set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, then run `unstale setup`.\r\n"]
[1.78,"o","\r\n"]
[1.84,"o","↑↓ to move · Enter to choose\r\n"]
[1.9,"o","\r\n"]
[1.96,"o","Add one of these lines to your shell profile or this repo's .env, then run `unstale setup`:\r\n"]
[2.02,"o","\r\n"]
